{"seq":1,"slug":"hitbox-hurtbox-systems","title":"攻击框与受击框系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/combat-system-design/hit-resolution/hitbox-hurtbox-systems","wordCount":1511,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"攻击框与受击框系统\">攻击框与受击框系统</h1><p>「打没打中」这个问题，引擎不靠看动画，而靠几何。每个角色身上挂着两套随动作移动的简化碰撞体：攻击框负责「我的伤害落在哪片空间」，受击框负责「我哪片身体会被打到」。在<a href=\"../foundations/action-states-frame-data\">动作状态机</a>的判定帧，引擎检测这两套框是否相交，从而把一段华丽的攻击动画压缩成一个干脆的布尔值。这一篇是整条「判定→反应→结算」链路的第一关。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-两套框的分工\">核心概念：两套框的分工</h2><p>攻击框（hitbox）和受击框（hurtbox）是一对功能相反的碰撞体，必须严格区分。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[攻击方动作进入判定帧] --&gt; B[激活攻击框 Hitbox]&#10;  C[受击方持续维护受击框 Hurtbox] --&gt; D&#10;  B --&gt; D{攻击框 ∩ 受击框?}&#10;  D --&gt;|相交| E[判定命中&lt;br/&gt;移交受击反应]&#10;  D --&gt;|不相交| F[落空 Whiff]&#10;  E --&gt; G[同一攻击对同一目标&lt;br/&gt;本次去重 不重复命中]\">flowchart TD\n  A[攻击方动作进入判定帧] --&gt; B[激活攻击框 Hitbox]\n  C[受击方持续维护受击框 Hurtbox] --&gt; D\n  B --&gt; D{攻击框 ∩ 受击框?}\n  D --&gt;|相交| E[判定命中&lt;br/&gt;移交受击反应]\n  D --&gt;|不相交| F[落空 Whiff]\n  E --&gt; G[同一攻击对同一目标&lt;br/&gt;本次去重 不重复命中]</pre><ul>\n<li>攻击框：只在判定帧存在，可能多个（拳脚、武器、爆风各一），通常用胶囊或盒体近似。</li>\n<li>受击框：几乎全程存在，包裹角色身体；某些<a href=\"../foundations/action-states-frame-data\">无敌帧</a>会临时关闭它。</li>\n<li>二者来自不同阵营才判命中，自己的攻击框不会打到自己的受击框。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>攻击框 Hitbox</th>\n<th>受击框 Hurtbox</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>存在时机</td>\n<td>仅判定帧</td>\n<td>几乎全程（无敌帧除外）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数量</td>\n<td>常多个</td>\n<td>常多个（头/身/腿分段）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>几何</td>\n<td>胶囊/盒体</td>\n<td>胶囊/盒体/球</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用途</td>\n<td>定义伤害空间</td>\n<td>定义可被击中区域</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"几何与相交测试\">几何与相交测试</h2><p>战斗判定几乎从不用精确网格碰撞——太慢且对帧数据不友好。主流用轴对齐盒体（AABB）、定向盒体（OBB）、球体或胶囊体，因为它们的相交测试是常数时间的解析公式。例如两球相交当且仅当球心距小于半径和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lVert \\vec{c_1} - \\vec{c_2} \\rVert \\le r_1 + r_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∥</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>胶囊体之间的相交则归约为「两条线段最近距离」与半径和的比较。这些都是物理引擎窄相位检测的基本工具，本篇只取其「快且确定」的特性，完整的算法推导见兄弟 hub 的 <a href=\"../../game-physics/collision-detection/narrow-phase\">窄相位碰撞检测</a>。</p>\n<p>战斗判定与通用物理碰撞的关键差异在于：战斗框是「逻辑触发器」，相交后不产生物理反弹，而是触发伤害事件——这与<a href=\"../../game-physics/collision-response/impulse-resolution\">碰撞响应</a>里的冲量求解完全不同，二者不要混用同一套管线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"高速攻击与连续检测\">高速攻击与连续检测</h2><p>判定帧只有 2–4 帧，若一记快速突刺在两帧之间「穿过」了薄薄的敌人，离散检测就会漏判——这就是隧穿（tunneling）。解决办法是连续碰撞检测（CCD）：不只检测当前帧攻击框是否相交，而是把攻击框从上一帧位置到本帧位置「扫掠」成一条体积，检测整条扫掠路径是否与受击框相交。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>命中</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∃</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>:</mo><mtext> Hitbox</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∩</mo><mtext>Hurtbox</mtext><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>Hitbox</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>lerp</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>prev</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>cur</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{命中} \\iff \\exists\\, t \\in [0,1]:\\ \\text{Hitbox}(t)\\cap \\text{Hurtbox} \\ne \\varnothing,\\quad \\text{Hitbox}(t)=\\text{lerp}(p_{\\text{prev}}, p_{\\text{cur}}, t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7073em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">命中</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∃</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Hitbox</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Hurtbox</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∅</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Hitbox</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">lerp</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">prev</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cur</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>CCD 成本更高，因此通常只对「攻击框小、移动快」的招式开启。连续检测的通用实现见 <a href=\"../../game-physics/collision-detection/continuous-detection\">连续碰撞检测</a>，本篇关注的是何时该为攻击启用它。</p>\n<h2 id=\"命中去重与多段攻击\">命中去重与多段攻击</h2><p>同一记攻击框在判定帧持续存在多帧，若每帧都判一次命中，一拳就会打出三四下伤害。因此必须做命中去重：每次攻击维护一张「本次已命中目标」表，命中过的目标在该攻击的整个判定期内不再触发。</p>\n<p>但有些招式确实要打出多段（multi-hit），如旋风斩。这通过两种方式实现：要么把一招拆成多个时间错开的攻击框、各自独立去重；要么给同一攻击框设「命中间隔」（每隔 N 帧可对同一目标再次生效）。多段攻击是<a href=\"../systems-depth/combo-system-design\">连招</a>和<a href=\"damage-formulas-scaling\">伤害缩放</a>里需要特别处理的对象——每一段都要走一次伤害结算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"攻击框相杀与优先级\">攻击框相杀与优先级</h2><p>当双方攻击框同帧相交、各自又都打到对方受击框，谁赢？这就是相杀（trade / clash）问题。常见裁决规则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>双方互相命中（trade）：两人都吃伤害，常见于对拼。</li>\n<li>攻击框对攻击框相消（clash）：双方攻击抵消、都不掉血，多见于刀剑互砍。</li>\n<li>优先级裁决：给招式设优先级值，高优先级击穿低优先级。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>裁决规则深刻影响战斗气质：允许相杀的系统鼓励博弈和搏命，攻击框相消则营造「兵器交击」的爽感。这是一个纯设计选择，没有标准答案，但必须在系统层统一约定，否则边界情况会让玩家觉得判定「玄学」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可视化调试-让判定看得见\">可视化调试：让判定看得见</h2><p>攻击框系统极难凭肉眼调试——动画看着打中了，框却差几像素。因此几乎所有正经战斗项目都做「判定框可视化」：在调试模式下用半透明色块画出每帧的攻击框（红）和受击框（蓝），并显示当前帧号。这让策划能逐帧检查「攻击框是不是比动画手臂短了一截」「无敌帧覆盖范围对不对」。判定框数据通常和动画时间轴一起编辑，是整个战斗手感打磨里最高频的调试工具。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>命中判定靠几何：攻击框定义伤害空间、受击框定义可被击中区域，只在判定帧检测二者相交。</li>\n<li>用 AABB/OBB/球/胶囊等简化体做常数时间相交测试；战斗框是逻辑触发器，不产生物理反弹。</li>\n<li>高速薄攻击需连续检测（扫掠）防隧穿；多帧攻击需命中去重，多段攻击则靠分框或命中间隔实现。</li>\n<li>攻击框相杀有 trade/clash/优先级三类裁决，是塑造战斗气质的设计选择；判定框可视化是打磨手感的核心调试工具。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章下一篇：<a href=\"hit-reactions-hitstun\">受击反应与硬直</a> —— 判定命中之后受击方进入什么状态。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../foundations/action-states-frame-data\">动作状态与帧数据</a> —— 攻击框激活所在的判定帧。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../game-physics/collision-detection/narrow-phase\">窄相位碰撞检测</a> —— 框相交背后的几何算法。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"攻击框与受击框系统","id":"攻击框与受击框系统"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：两套框的分工","id":"核心概念-两套框的分工"},{"level":2,"text":"几何与相交测试","id":"几何与相交测试"},{"level":2,"text":"高速攻击与连续检测","id":"高速攻击与连续检测"},{"level":2,"text":"命中去重与多段攻击","id":"命中去重与多段攻击"},{"level":2,"text":"攻击框相杀与优先级","id":"攻击框相杀与优先级"},{"level":2,"text":"可视化调试：让判定看得见","id":"可视化调试-让判定看得见"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"输入缓冲与响应性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/combat-system-design/foundations/input-buffering-responsiveness"},"next":{"title":"受击反应与硬直","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/combat-system-design/hit-resolution/hit-reactions-hitstun"}}